{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"9113f6895bb3c1522a19b0a14958f15cd80e1e2e30ceb732f73c30274b98611a","digest":{"component_or_area":"outbound type mapping and config layer","key_entities":["config.effective_type_map","config.assert_type_decisions_complete","config.effective_excluded_sync_types","config.jira_to_local_type","LOCAL_TYPE_TO_JIRA","EXCLUDED_SYNC_TYPES","mapping_config.SKIP","rebar-type: label","outbound_labels._REBAR_TYPE_LABEL_PREFIX","inbound_fields.recover_type_label","outbound_differ.py","outbound_fields._map_local_to_jira_fields","jira_datacenter/backend.py","_desired_type_annotation","_diff_type_annotation_labels","TicketType"],"problem_keywords":["config-driven type mapping","type-granular skip","round-trip safety","rebar-type annotation","fail-closed validation","lossy type collapse"],"propositions":["Type mapping must be config-driven via a per-project type_map axis, with SKIP as the per-type exclusion signal, mirroring the existing status_map pattern","Fail-closed validation fires once up-front at compute_outbound_mutations before mutations are built, ensuring every syncable type is decided or explicitly skipped","Per-project excluded sync types are the union of built-in EXCLUDED_SYNC_TYPES and any types mapped to SKIP in the project's effective type_map","The rebar-type: annotation label must be stamped symmetrically with rebar-status: when type collapsing occurs, and recovered inbound without requiring a reverse map lookup","Type mapping must thread through all three OutboundMapper implementations and both field mappers (Cloud and DataCenter) without breaking signatures","The rebar-type: prefix must be added to all four internal label prefix filter tuples across outbound, inbound, differ, and translate modules to prevent spurious sync mutations"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787501570597611001,"uuid":"6cb9bec3-e067-489a-9632-a6222d031804"}